ます。お好きなように描いてください！\nよろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tukiniyoukoso/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0f86191/uploads/origins/d4e6cf7f-ecc9-48a7-9a45-d1f7f705e6ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a5d7e66b7a309c12a504aa6f3886403", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0f86191/uploads/origins/d4e6cf7f-ecc9-48a7-9a45-d1f7f705e6ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a5d7e66b7a309c12a504aa6f3886403, https://si.imgix.net/a0f86191/uploads/origins/d4e6cf7f-ecc9-48a7-9a45-d1f7f705e6ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f56429e020de149b7746539b6143020e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0f86191/uploads/origins/d4e6cf7f-ecc9-48a7-9a45-d1f7f705e6ce?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=314123bbf48b25d99f664eb2e3562f66 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "通り過がりの誰かです。いつも大好きです。\n白虎さんとメアリちゃんとナビィちゃんが\n並んでいるところが見たいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tukiniyoukoso/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c301f37/uploads/origins/19d67c2e-8a5d-4746-a9d1-4891c511ec94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d1c774a4c310e7f00125aca017fa02c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c301f37/uploads/origins/19d67c2e-8a5d-4746-a9d1-4891c511ec94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d1c774a4c310e7f00125aca017fa02c, https://si.imgix.net/2c301f37/uploads/origins/19d67c2e-8a5d-4746-a9d1-4891c511ec94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1699a8804d85021a676ca2a05ebef5d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c301f37/uploads/origins/19d67c2e-8a5d-4746-a9d1-4891c511ec94?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7f7ae9b601015c81f5981f3d190f9c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "紳月先生こんにちは！\nよければVとして活動している大魔王赤石のお姿を